<title>CHINA: CHINA ALUMINIUM DEMAND SEEN 2.8 MILLION T BY 2010.</title>
<headline>CHINA ALUMINIUM DEMAND SEEN 2.8 MILLION T BY 2010.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's annual demand for aluminium is expected to reach 2.8 million tonnes by the year 2010 and 3.76 million tonnes by the year 2020, the China Daily Business Weekly said on Sunday.</p>
<p>It was quoting figures provided by the Ministry of Geology and Mineral Resources.</p>
<p>China has estimated demand for aluminium to reach 1.9-2.0 million tonnes this year from 1.75 million tonnes in 1996.</p>
</text>
